on, without arms or a mouth, utterly lost in an alien and hostile land. There he is found by a robotic companion named PUCK, who declares him her eighth summoning attempt, and a mysterious being grants him a prosthetic arm so he may wield a sword, transforming him into a Swordsman. Together, the two set out across the devastated world, soon uncovering that Xevious lies under the control of a malevolent supercomputer called Gamp, which has corrupted the planet's life and technology alike.", "summary": "Shadow Labyrinth is a 2D action platformer and a genre-twisting alternate take on the iconic PAC-MAN. As The Swordsman, you wake on a mysterious planet amidst relics of wars past. To survive you will discover secrets, consume your enemies, and grow from prey to apex predator.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/shadow-labyrinth--1", "videos": [{"id": 135480, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "U5pb3vapXxo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U5pb3vapXxo", "title": "Shadow Labyrinth Reveal Trailer The Game Awards 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U5pb3vapXxo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 144421, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "ROs-PqODrtQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ROs-PqODrtQ", "title": "Shadow Labyrinth \u2013 Release Date Trailer \u2013 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ROs-PqODrtQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155092, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "L5inY5ySdd0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L5inY5ySdd0", "title": "Shadow Labyrinth - Nintendo Switch 2 Pre-Order Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L5inY5ySdd0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 156450, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "lOkvS-OgJzw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lOkvS-OgJzw", "title": "Shadow Labyrinth - Launch Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lOkvS-OgJzw/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2095, "name": "Pac-Man"}]}